('690744', 'individual', 'RA KY''ONG-SU', 'RA KY ONG SU', 'DPRK', 'KPi.008', '2013-01-22', 'Democratic People''s Republic of Korea', NULL, 'Ra Ky''ong-Su is a Tanchon Commercial Bank (TCB) official. In this capacity he has facilitated transactions for TCB. Tanchon was designated by the Committee in April 2009 as the main DPRK financial entity responsible for sales of conventional arms, ballistic missiles, and goods related to the assembly and manufacture of such weapons.', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
('690745', 'individual', 'KIM KWANG-IL', 'KIM KWANG IL', 'DPRK', 'KPi.009', '2013-01-22', 'Democratic People''s Republic of Korea', NULL, 'Kim Kwang-il is a Tanchon Commercial Bank (TCB) official. In this capacity, he has facilitated transactions for TCB and the Korea Mining Development Trading Corporation (KOMID). Tanchon was designated by the Committee in April 2009 as the main DPRK financial entity responsible for sales of conventional arms, ballistic missiles, and goods related to the assembly and manufacture of such weapons. KOMID was designated by the Committee in April 2009 and is the DPRK’s primary arms dealer and main exporter of goods and equipment related to ballistic missiles and conventional weapons.', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
('690746', 'individual', 'YO''N CHO''NG NAM', 'YO N CHO NG NAM', 'DPRK', 'KPi.010', '2013-03-07', 'Democratic People''s Republic of Korea', NULL, 'Chief Representative for the Korea Mining Development Trading Corporation (KOMID). The KOMID was designated by the Committee in April 2009 and is the DPRK’s primary arms dealer and main exporter of goods and equipment related to ballistic missiles and conventional weapons.', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
