('6908620', 'individual', 'KIM NAM UNG', 'KIM NAM UNG', 'DPRK', 'KPi.061', '2017-08-05', 'Democratic People''s Republic of Korea', NULL, 'Representative for Ilsim International Bank, which is affiliated with the DPRK military and has a close relationship with the Korea Kwangson Banking Corporation. Ilsim International Bank has attempted to evade United Nations sanctions.', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
('6908621', 'individual', 'Pak Il Kyu', 'PAK IL KYU', 'DPRK', 'KPi.062', '2017-08-05', 'Democratic People''s Republic of Korea', NULL, 'Official for Korea Ryonbong General Corporation, which specializes in acquisition for DPRK’s defense industries and support to Pyongyang’s military-related sales. Its procurements also likely support the DPRK’s chemical weapons program. Gender: male.', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
('6908626', 'individual', 'PAK YONG SIK', 'PAK YONG SIK', 'DPRK', 'KPi.063', '2017-09-11', 'Democratic People''s Republic of Korea', 'Democratic People''s Republic of Korea', 'Pak Yong Sik is a member of the Workers’ Party of Korea Central Military Commission, which is responsible for the development and implementation of the Workers’ Party of Korea military policies, commands and controls the DPRK’s military, and helps direct the country’s military defense industries.', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
('6908640', 'individual', 'CH''OE SO’K MIN', 'CH OE SO’K MIN', 'DPRK', 'KPi.064', '2017-12-22', 'Democratic People''s Republic of Korea', NULL, 'In 2016, Ch’oe So’k-min was the deputy representative at the Foreign Trade Bank branch office in that overseas location. He has been associated with cash transfers from that overseas Foreign Trade Bank office to banks affiliated with North Korean special organizations and Reconnaissance General Bureau operatives located overseas in an effort to evade sanctions. Gender: male.', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
