('111794', 'individual', 'MOKHTAR BELMOKHTAR', 'MOKHTAR BELMOKHTAR', 'Al-Qaida', 'QDi.136', '2003-11-11', 'Algeria', NULL, 'Reportedly deceased in November 2016. Father''s name is Mohamed. Mother''s name is Zohra Chemkha. Member of the Council of the Organization of Al-Qaida in the Islamic Maghreb (QDe.014) (AQIM). Head of Al Mouakaoune Biddam (QDe.139), Al Moulathamoun (QDe.140) and Al Mourabitoun (QDe.141) INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice:https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
