('6908413', 'individual', 'SEIFALLAH BEN OMAR BEN MOHAMED BEN HASSINE', 'SEIFALLAH BEN OMAR BEN MUHAMMAD BEN HASSINE', 'Al-Qaida', 'QDi.333', '2014-09-23', 'Tunisia', '60 Rue de la Libye, Hammam Lif, Ben Arous, Tunisia; Libya, possible location as at Jul. 2017', 'Founder of the Tunisian Combatant Group (QDe.090) and leader of Ansar al-Shari''a in Tunisia (AAS-T) (QDe.143). Arrest warrant issued by Tunisian Court of First Instance on 23 Aug. 2013 INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice:https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
