('6908484', 'individual', 'ASEEL MUTHANA', 'ASEEL MUTHANA', 'Al-Qaida', 'QDi.357', '2015-09-30', 'United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland', 'Syrian Arab Republic, as at Feb. 2014; United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland, previous address', 'Foreign terrorist fighter with Islamic State in Iraq and the Levant, listed as Al-Qaida in Iraq (QDe.115), in the Syrian Arab Republic. Wanted by the authorities of the United Kingdom. Physical description: hair colour: brown/black INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice:https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals', 'https://main.un.org/securitycouncil/en/content/un-sc-consolidated-list', 1, '2026-11-22'),
